Checklist:
- MODEL (ModelId, ModelName, Brand, #CategoryId) and ACCESSORY (AccessoryId, AccessoryName, DailyPrice): new tables, each with its primary key;
- BIKE: Model, Brand and CategoryId removed, #ModelId added;
- RENTAL_ACCESSORY (#RentalId, #AccessoryId, Quantity): composite key, two arrows.
The most common mistake: CategoryId left in BIKE instead of moving to MODEL. It is the only « other solution » of the answer key, and it is accepted only in part (« Almost »).
